# Terms that must never appear in a committed file. One per line, # for comments.
#
#   cp .forbidden_terms.example .forbidden_terms
#
# check_secrets.py reads this list and fails the pre-push scan if any term shows
# up in a file git would publish. TI_BRAND_NAME and TI_BRAND_COLOR from .env are
# included automatically, so list only the extras here.
#
# The real file is gitignored — spelling these terms out in a committed file
# would leak the very thing the check exists to protect.

# Your surname, so it cannot reappear as a form placeholder or sample value.
#Doe

# Internal hostnames that should never be named in public source.
#intranet.example-corp.com

# Legacy brand colours replaced by TI_BRAND_COLOR.
##1A2B3C
